    "flavor_text": {
        "sun": "If a Luvdisc is left on its own, it becomes despondent, leaving itself open to attack. That is when Pelipper snatch them up.",
        "moon": "Loving couples have a soft spot for this Pokémon, so honeymoon hotels often release this Pokémon into their pools.",
        "ultra-sun": "There was an era when it was overfished due to the rumor that having one of its heart-shaped scales would enable you to find a sweetheart.",
